un5|a|To reduce to an even surface or one approaching evenness; to make flat; to level; to make plane. ; To throw down; to bring to the ground; to prostrate; hence, to depress; to deject; to dispirit. ; To make vapid or insipid; to render stale. ; To lower the pitch of; to cause to sound less sharp; to let fall from the pitch.	j:197i,68,30~197i,68,30
