uyg|n|A motion like that of waves; a moving in this and that direction; as, the fluctuations of the sea. ; A wavering; unsteadiness; as, fluctuations of opinion; fluctuations of prices. ; The motion or undulation of a fluid collected in a natural or artifical cavity, which is felt when it is subjected to pressure or percussion.	a:10xb,62,6;22gw,19,3~10xb,62,6;22gw,19,3
